XGS Silicon: a theme for the OPNsense web GUI on Sophos XGS appliances, in three parts -
xgs (light), xgs-dark (dark) and xgs-auto, which follows the browser's own light or dark
setting. A carbon bar and menu in both modes, copper for actions, teal for the data path,
and IBM Plex - Latin, Arabic and Mono - inside the theme, so nothing is fetched from the
internet. Built on OPNsense's own themes; no page changes its layout.

WWW: https://github.com/AbdelmonemAwad/os-theme-xgs
